{"title":"Career Roadmap · Lifestyle Consultant","role":"Lifestyle Consultant","summary":"A Lifestyle Consultant with a BNYS background focuses on health promotion, wellness, preventive lifestyle practices, nutrition-related counselling within professional scope, yoga, physical activity, stress management, sleep, and behaviour change.","facts":{"Current degree":"BNYS (Naturopathy & Yogic Sciences)","Course":"Naturopathy & Yoga"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Lifestyle Consultant with a BNYS background focuses on health promotion, wellness, preventive lifestyle practices, nutrition-related counselling within professional scope, yoga, physical activity, stress management, sleep, and behaviour change."},{"type":"p","text":"The role is especially relevant to the growing focus on:"},{"type":"h","text":"Preventive healthcare"},{"type":"h","text":"Lifestyle-related conditions"},{"type":"h","text":"Workplace wellness"},{"type":"h","text":"Corporate health"},{"type":"h","text":"Yoga and wellness"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital health"},{"type":"h","text":"Health coaching"},{"type":"h","text":"Community wellness"},{"type":"h","text":"Integrative healthcare"},{"type":"p","text":"A BNYS graduate has a broader health-science foundation than a generic wellness coach because the degree includes structured education in naturopathy, yoga, basic medical sciences, nutrition, lifestyle management, and clinical exposure."},{"type":"p","text":"The exact professional scope, registration requirements, and permitted clinical titles should be verified under the applicable current regulatory framework and state/institutional requirements."}]},{"heading":"Career Pathway","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"BNYS"},{"type":"h","text":"Compulsory Internship"},{"type":"h","text":"Professional Registration / Eligibility"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical & Wellness Experience"},{"type":"h","text":"Life